doc:Factsarticle_1_1 schema:abstract "Cutting tools are executive components in metal processing, and tool wear directly affects workpiece quality and processing efficiency. The article integrates force, vibration, and acoustic emission sensor signals with a denoising autoencoder and support vector regression model to establish a tool wear monitoring model."@en .
